'''Li'l Sakonji Urokodaki''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 847
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Li'l Sakonji Urokodaki
|name2 = Li'l Sakonji Urokodaki CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Li'l Sakonji Urokodaki CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Just like [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], Li'l Sakonji Urokodaki is a respectable [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]]/[[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Zombie]] tank. He has a sizeable 199,750 effective HP at Lv.30 (317,250 at Lv.50), which is more than enough to hold his ground against targets for a decent period of time. Not only that, he has a reasonable recharge rate that makes him decently spammable. He works well in places like [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]] [[Zombie Outbreaks|outbreaks]].

His niche as an anti-[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] tank is valuable given the scarcity, despite lacking Zombie Killer. Against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]], he remains powerful up until you unlock [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]], who tends to outclass him in most regards, with its Weaken ability massively improving its own survivability. Nevertheless, being [[Immune to Warp]] still gives him meaningful utility in certain stages.

